Magnetic resonance imaging of the whole neuraxis and
EEG were also normal. Cerebrospinal fluid examination
was unremarkable, there were no atypical cells found on
cytopathological analysis. Electromyography of the lower
limbs revealed no abnormalit ies. Serologic testing for</seg>
